This extension adds Far Cry 3 modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]Epic[/*]
[*]Ubisoft Connect[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]
[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Installs FC3 Mod Installer itself to the "FCModInstaller" folder, recognised by a "fcmodinstaller.exe" file.[/*]
[*]Installs Ziggy's mod with a file or folder named "readme - ziggy's mod.txt".[/*]
[*]Installs Root Folder mod with a "bin" folder or a """" file to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[*]Installs Game Data mod with a ".dat" file to the "data_win32" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs Binaries (Engine Injector) mod with a file with the ".dll" extension to the "bin" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs XML Settings mod with a file or folder named "gamerprofile.xml" to the "DOCUMENTS\My Games\Far Cry 3" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs Repacked FCMI mod with a file or folder named "info.xml" to the "FCModInstaller\ModifiedFilesFC3" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs FCMI Mod (.a2/.a3/.a4/.a5/.bin) mod with a ".a2" file to the "FCModInstaller\ModifiedFilesFC3" folder.[/*]
[*]Any other mod not described above is installed to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[*]Archives with a FOMOD installer (a "fomod" folder with ModuleConfig.xml) are handed to Vortex's built-in FOMOD installer instead.[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

